flowchart TD
  Manual[Manual source] --> Intent[Authorized upload intent]
  External[Documentary connector - future] -.-> Source[KnowledgeSource with opaque provenance]
  Manual --> Source
  Source --> Doc[Document]
  Intent --> S3[Private versioned S3 POST]
  S3 --> Verify[HEAD and bounded SHA256 of pinned VersionId]
  Verify --> Version[Finalize document version]
  Doc --> Version
  Version --> Job[Transactional ingestion request V1]
  Job -.-> Worker[Document worker - future]
  Worker -.-> Index[Chunks embeddings retrieval - future]
